  "kind": "excel-differs-from-math",
  "title": "SINH splits at |x| = 1 between internal Kahan expm1 and x87-stored EXP difference, differing by 1 ULP on small inputs",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0 builds 20326 through 20527, SINH(number) evaluates (expm1(x) - expm1(-x)) / 2 using Excel's internal binary64 Kahan expm1 for |x| < 1, switches at |x| >= 1 to RN53(RN64(EXP(x) - EXP(-x))) / 2, and rejects overflow above ln(DBL_MAX) (~709.78) with #NUM!. Because Excel builds expm1 from its x87 EXP/LN primitives, SINH(0.013409894617721019) differs by 1 ULP from mathematical sinh(x). Of 33,551 full-bank SINH rows, 33,547 match and 4 differ by 1 ULP.",
  "status": "measured",
  "basis": "Measured across Excel 16.0 build 20430 and 16.0.20527.20196 (33,547/33,551 full-bank and 120/120 pinned SINH rows) and 16.0.20527.20088 in prefix_metadata (row 203).",
